                          6  Predicted Enhancements
                          =========================

     Here's a list of features which will probably be added sometime in the
future:
       o FidoNet
       o UUCP/UseNet
       o Ability to write messages with ANSI
       o Ability to quote from another message when writing a message
       o Doors which are run as if they are a normal BBS command
       o Batch downloading
       o Batch uploading
       o Browse new mode similar to C-Net's RA command
       o Ability for user to download part of a file, then resume as time
         permits.  For example, there's this 1200 baud caller trying to
         download a 800k program.  This caller only has 60 minutes remaining,
         so he uses this feature to download as much as he can in the 60
         minutes he has.  When his time runs out, the transfer aborts.  But,
         the next time he calls, he resumes his download and finishes the
         transfer.
       o Voting booth implementation as a door
       o BBS Listing Utility as a door

